  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></math> be an isosceles triangle in which <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> is at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mo>∠</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math> is on the positive <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo></math>axis. If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math>  and the line <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></math> intersects the line <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></math> at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math> then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msup><mi>β</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><msup><mi>α</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math> is:"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "36",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>≡</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0043_99c2a1350041.png\" style=\"width: 350px; height: 120px;\"/></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Now, finding point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math> using parametric form we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>sin</mi><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>≡</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>B</mi><msup><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>So, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mo>≡</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now, equation of line <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></math> is given by,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Solving with line <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>x</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mo> </mo><mtext>and</mtext><mo> </mo><mi>β</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>β</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><msup><mi>α</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>81</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>β</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><msup><mi>α</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>β</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><msup><mi>α</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn></math></p>"
  }
